- op: discuss  # 5460
  at: '2026-03-30T20:04:41Z'  # 5460
  by: agent  # 5460
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 5460
  clock: 7  # 5460
  nonce: '5460'  # 5460
  message: "Manual concurrent test attempted Mar 30. Created a docs PR (#2635), started auto-pr, triggered tracker sync during CI poll. Results inconclusive: CI runner was hung (Go HTTP/2 pool deadlock — see self-hosted-forgejo-shpilkes-analysis.md), so auto-pr timed out. The tracker auto-sync correctly detected an in-flight PR and waited rather than interfering. After runner restart and GODEBUG=http2client=0 mitigation, CI recovered. Will retest when next real feature PR goes through."  # 5460
