  message: "Fixed in PR #2637. Three race conditions closed: (1) PR_PENDING gate created before push (was after), (2) re-check TRACKER_SYNC_PENDING before push, (3) proactive rebase after CI poll if dev advanced. PR #2637 itself was the live test — auto-pr ran with the new code and merged successfully. Holding: remaining race #8 (competing simultaneous merges) requires distributed locking, lower priority."  # e947
